Z||000003||1FST2M6||03-16-2001||10:11 AM||||your only running 13.7? have you ever dynoed the car to make sure the electronics are working properly? my best time on DOT slicks was 13.6@103.... uum i think theres somthing amiss with your set up. what *resonators* are you talking about? exhaust that was too small? running that motor a single 3" would support that all day with room to grow! i can't get your page to come up.. i'll keep trying.. maybe my DSL is flaking... cause it keeps timing out... <BR> <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A>  - <A HREF="http://www.enthuzacar.com" TARGET=_blank>www.enthuzacar.com</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Jay||03-16-2001||02:19 PM||||1FST2M6, Yes I know the car has alot more in it.  If you've read my other posts you'll see that I'm only running at about 70% power because of the sufisticated Northstar computer.  Trying to find ways to trick it.  The exhaust was way to restrictive before (I didn't want to attract to much attention hence the resonators).  Now I just want to go fast!!!  Exhaust now is two 2.5" pipes with 2 catalytics on each bank (true dual).  I noticed the difference immediately.||||reg||1
